---
// PricingSection.astro
---

<section id="precios" class="py-24 bg-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#2ECC71]"></span>
        <span>ACCESO BETA ANTICIPADO</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#2C4A5E] tracking-tight">
        Comienza gratis hoy. <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#7FBDA3] to-[#25D366]">Sin trucos ni tarjetas.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#4A5568]">
        Únete a la fase Beta abierta y asegura tu acceso gratuito ilimitado de por vida.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pricing Cards Grid -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Plan Beta Gratuito (Destacado) -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#182C38] via-[#213A4B] to-[#2C4A5E] text-white shadow-2xl relative flex flex-col justify-between border border-[#6BA5C8]/40">
        
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#25D366] to-[#128C7E] text-white text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider py-1 px-3.5 rounded-full shadow-md">
          ACTIVO AHORA
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase font-extrabold tracking-widest text-[#7FBDA3]">Early Adopter</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-2">Beta Abierta</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">Acceso completo y gratuito para los primeros usuarios.</p>

          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-6">
            <span class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-white">$0</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300 text-sm font-semibold">/ de por vida para beta testers</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-xs text-slate-200 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/30 text-[#7FBDA3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Registro ilimitado de gastos e ingresos</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/30 text-[#7FBDA3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Transcripción de notas de voz con <strong>Whisper</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/30 text-[#7FBDA3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Lectura OCR de facturas con <strong>Gemini 2.5 Flash</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/30 text-[#7FBDA3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Recordatorios automáticos de cierre (2 PM y 8 PM)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/30 text-[#7FBDA3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Resumen diario con cifras exactas a las 9:00 PM</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#7FBDA3]/30 text-[#7FBDA3] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Corrección conversacional ("no, eran 15 mil")</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/573332937647" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="block w-full py-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#25D366] to-[#128C7E] text-white font-extrabold text-sm text-center shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 hover:opacity-95 transition-opacity"
        >
          Unirme a la Beta por WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Plan Pro (Roadmap / Próximamente) -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200/80 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-85">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase font-extrabold tracking-widest text-[#D4A574]">Próximamente</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-[#2C4A5E] mb-2">SmartSavings Pro</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#4A5568] mb-6">Para nómadas digitales, freelancers y familias.</p>

          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-6">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#2C4A5E]">En Camino</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-semibold">(Q4 2026)</span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-xs text-[#4A5568] mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#6BA5C8] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Soporte multi-moneda en tiempo real (COP, USD, EUR)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#6BA5C8] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Alertas de inflación y comparador de precios por producto</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#6BA5C8] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Asistente de voz por llamadas (WhatsApp Calling API)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#6BA5C8] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Exportación avanzada a PDF y dashboards web</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#6BA5C8] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Cuentas compartidas para parejas y microempresas</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#4A5568]">
            Los usuarios de la Beta tendrán precio preferencial de por vida.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
